🎯 Assignment Objective

The objective of this assignment is to help students:


•   Understand Sysmon (System Monitor) as a host-based logging and detection tool
•   Correlate real user activities with Sysmon Event IDs
•   Develop log analysis, investigation, and reporting skills

Task:
Each student must perform ANY 5 user-generated activities from the list below or even of his own choice, remembering the events ID which can be recorded by SYSMON. (https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/sysinternals/downloads/sysmon#events)

The observing student must identify, analyze, and document those activities using Sysmon logs.    

Activities: 
Process Execution
File Creation / Modification
Registry Modification 
Network Activity 
Scheduled Task / Persistence 
USB / External Media Usage
or any other
